  "AC": "END (parent done when all WorkItems done):\n1. `onboardctl` launcher + ABC registry under thermo/onboard/onboardctl; `onboardctl help` lists subcommands.\n2. zonespec: zone (default), hardware (fuzzy esp32/esp32s3), dialect, type; multi-match listed; mutating cmds refuse ambiguous sets.\n3. Subcommands logs, version, deviceinfo, sendcommand (defaults + undo), setvar work against mocked transport in tests; at least one live backend exercised without DMZ (or documented dry-run gate if board offline).\n4. README/AGENTS note: onboardctl = direct board; manage = DMZ.\n5. `make test` (or onboard suite target) covers parser/zonespec/subcommand unit tests.",
